OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKane street name would be 'source
OL,4,Aof civic pride'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland football captain Harry Kane
OL,7,Fshould have a London street named after
OL,8,Fhim, according to former leader of the
OL,9,FConservative party Iain Duncan-Smith.
OL,11,FNow the MP for Chingford and Woodford
OL,12,FGreen, Duncan-Smith, along with Waltham
OL,13,FForest councillors, requested a street
OL,14,Fbe renamed after the England and Bayern
OL,15,FMunich striker as "a lasting source of
OL,16,Fcivic pride for the borough".
OL,18,FKane, England's most capped player and
OL,19,Ftop goal scorer, was born in nearby
OL,20,FLeytonstone and grew up in Chingford.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
